{"server":"cn","storyId":"act16d5_level_act16d5_05_end","groupId":"act16d5","stageId":"act16d5_05","title":"拙山","storyCode":"WR-5","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act16d5/level_act16d5_05_end.txt","sourceHash":"5dac47c92ec1fb434de7e55059b2c291e2c91eba742b8c3626667290504c68b8","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"不知为何日夜流转恢复正常，墨魉也不再畏惧阳光，大杀特杀，众人竭力保护村民，乌有也出乎预料地展现出拳脚功夫，却仍旧力有不逮。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_white"},{"type":"narration","text":"烟雾是城市的血。\n我曾见过月面的轮廓模糊不见，只留下宛如雕刻似的斑迹工整地留在天上，月色顺着被刺破的边界流入天空，晕染一片。\n我曾见我热爱的家园陷于火海。我被迫翻山越岭，从这头走到那头。\n我见过饥饿的灾民互相蚕食。当鲜血淋漓的厮杀发生时，就在擦肩而过的距离，人可以像无事发生过那样，看着前方，行走。\n我见过那条漫漫长路，我曾疑惑为何所有人都会选择同一条道路，死亡是注定的，我们只是在麻木中殊途同归。\n我见过荒漠与青山绿水，见过因一个踉跄就再也没有爬起来过的朋友，见过父母那只是短短一瞬的想要抛下自己的眼神。\n——我见过你。\n我认得你。\n你的眼睛。你高高在上的，冰冷的，孤独的眼睛。\n比遭遇天灾袭击，被父母遗弃，在饥饿与垂死边缘挣扎的我还要悲哀，莫大的悲哀。\n你在看我，还是在看你自己？\n我记得，我这么问过你。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_town"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"别过来！别过来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"它、它吃掉了我的手，哈、哈哈，我怎么一点感觉不到疼，我——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魉","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"噫——别过来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"你没事吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"你为什么才来！！为什么没有人敲钟！那个守岁的僧人去哪儿了！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"明明是信任你们，才按你们说的去做的，为什么！为什么我丈夫会死！你们要怎么赔，要怎么赔！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......先离开这里再说。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_landscape"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"唔啊啊——妈妈，妈妈，你还我妈妈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魉","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"唔哦！这次也是千钧一发啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"叔、叔叔，妈妈，妈妈——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魉","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"先不论这个小家伙，外面好像有些不得了的大玩意啊，小姑娘，抓好了，咱们要开溜了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魉","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎啊——！嘎啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"又来一只！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_town"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"根本、根本解决不完！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魉","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎啊——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魉","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"它们到底是从哪里冒出来的......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，这个数量，根本不可能全部拦得住——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘎......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"虽是画中物，倒也不必如此赶尽杀绝......此般景象，看得直教人捶胸顿足。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"炎熔施主，这里有小僧看着，快去带他人避难。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"无需担心小僧，小僧在此地游历数载，虽对未来之事有了种种念想，忧虑不定——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"——但小僧未有一刻，对身前之事有分毫惘然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"此地，交给小僧罢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。继续往东边走，你结束了找我们汇合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"明白！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魉","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎啊！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"小僧在此，莫要向前一步！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"过此界者，当斩。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_town"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔啊啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎哟！我的小姑奶奶！能不能别揪我的头发了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"妈妈——妈妈——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘎啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"这玩意就会嘎嘎嘎地叫，这么能追你怎么不吐几句人话呢！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......别......跑......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀妈呀，我就说着玩的，不必如此，大可不必如此呀——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呜呜呜，叔叔，前、前面！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"呃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"咿呀！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你是那个算命的......？其他两位英雄在哪儿呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"你身后，身后！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魉","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么把它们引来了！你快想想办法——想想办法啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"我能想什么办法！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"你把它们引开，引开啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我也......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"呜呜呜，呜啊啊啊，妈妈，妈妈——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"哎哟，快别哭了！别哭！丫头，别哭了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！那些东西看过来了！你快去啊，你快去——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魉","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎啊啊啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"欸......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"用、用扇子？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"......你们躲远点。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魉","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎嗷？嘎啊——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"]"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"一招就......！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗷！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"厉、厉害......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"哎哟哟，疼死我了疼死我了，这些玩意到底是什么，怎么看着软绵绵的，打上去这么厚实呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，别看我啦，俗话说得好，驮兽急了也咬人，咱们还是赶紧跑路吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魉","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎嗷......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，虽然拳脚功夫不错，但小乌有你从来没有在这种情况下救人的经验吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"只解决眼前的敌人而不注意全方位的动静，迟早会吃亏的哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"啊、啊哈哈......刚才可真险呐！多亏了恩人，我才能安然无恙呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"......好啦，赶紧带着剩下的人避难去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，恩人您？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"我？没关系，我脚步很轻，它们发现不了我的啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"（就这身手，脚步轻就能解释得了吗！？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"之后......该怎么迅速削减这些墨魉的数量呢......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"咿呀！园、园子里的火光是什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_town"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"唔哦！火光冲天，蔚为壮观！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"唔？莫非“炎熔”二字，便取此中意？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_landscape"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"小炎熔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......帮我确定附近所有敌人的分布范围。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"这么大阵仗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"本来担心波及到周遭的建筑，一直不怎么敢随便用法术......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......但敌人太多了，这样慢吞吞对付下去，受害者数量恐怕难以估量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"明白，特殊时期特殊手段嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"我去找个高处，你就安心施法吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"所有超出法术范围的敌人我都会帮忙解决的，保证一个不落。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"之后的任务报告我来提交......毕竟罗德岛该帮助的，不止是感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......没什么，在此之前，小炎熔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"你有看到煮伞先生吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","aliases":["炎熔"]},{"speakerId":"char_362_Saga","aliases":["嵯峨"]},{"speakerId":"char_455_nothing","aliases":["乌有","墨魉"]}]}
